{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52318","headline":"诗（幷序） 七十九 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 七十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆生眼盼盼，心路甚堂堂。\n三（袁、项校「一」）种逐耶娘，一种惜身命，一种忧死亡。\n侧长恭勉（张改作「抛」）面，长生跪拜羊。\n口中不解语，情下极荒忙。\n何忍刺他煞，曾无阡许惶。\n牛头捉得你，镬里熟煎汤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}